# Copy to local.patch.yaml (gitignored) to patch the active AgentProfile at runtime.
# Merged after seeds/agents/profiles/{id}.yaml and seeds/agents/overlays/*.patch.yaml.
#
# Example — enable skill handler short-circuit locally:
# runtime:
